WEBVTT

00:05.540 --> 00:07.920
Snazzy, ain't it?

00:07.920 --> 00:10.170
My suit. It's brand new!

00:10.170 --> 00:12.500
The shirt and the necktie, too.

00:12.750 --> 00:15.750
Oh! Let's take a nice selfie together first!

00:15.750 --> 00:18.960
If there's something you'd like to discuss,
please keep it brief.

00:19.250 --> 00:22.210
Although I can probably venture a guess...

00:23.540 --> 00:25.210
My goodness...

00:25.210 --> 00:27.540
things have gotten messy, haven't they?

00:28.040 --> 00:31.500
I mean, the Republic's facing enormous
backlash from the global community

00:31.500 --> 00:33.500
over their little terrorism incident.

00:32.080 --> 00:34.790
<b>Breaking News</b>

00:32.080 --> 00:34.790
<b>Mysterious Explosion</b>

00:32.090 --> 00:34.790
<b>at the Bureau of Magic</b>

00:33.500 --> 00:34.790
What a disaster...

00:35.080 --> 00:38.960
Of course it would happen now, just when
we've begun moving towards peace...

00:38.960 --> 00:42.500
Peace wasn't an option from the very start.

00:42.960 --> 00:47.710
The Kingdom would never accept the Republic's
terms or recognize its claims to the land.

00:47.710 --> 00:52.000
Then what are we supposed to do?
Hm, Freddie?

00:52.000 --> 00:54.250
This means there's no way to avoid

00:54.250 --> 00:56.880
a full-blown war between us
and the Republic, right?

00:56.880 --> 01:00.580
Still, at the end of the day,
the Republic's got Leo on their side...

01:01.000 --> 01:02.540
And as long as he's around,

01:02.540 --> 01:05.960
trying to attack 'em the normal way
just ain't gonna fly.

01:08.170 --> 01:09.420
Without Leo...

01:10.790 --> 01:12.250
Without Leo...?

01:12.500 --> 01:14.250
If Leo conveniently goes missing,

01:14.250 --> 01:17.380
the Republic loses its power
and crumbles to pieces.

01:17.380 --> 01:19.000
If the shoe fits.

01:19.000 --> 01:22.000
It's an unfortunate situation,
but seeing as things have gotten this bad,

01:22.000 --> 01:25.830
it's high time we hold Leo accountable
and see to it that he disappears.

01:25.830 --> 01:30.210
But you and the Hero's other pals are
the only ones capable of pulling it off.

01:30.960 --> 01:33.920
We all know Max is a lost cause...

01:32.710 --> 01:33.920
<b>Max the Hero</b>

01:32.710 --> 01:33.920
<b>Cheating on 10 Different Women?!</b>

01:34.170 --> 01:36.670
...and Yuria's long since retired.

01:36.920 --> 01:40.420
I should be able to handle Leo
just fine by myself.

01:40.790 --> 01:42.380
Believe it or not...

01:42.960 --> 01:46.540
...I had a bosom buddy of my own
back in the day.

01:46.540 --> 01:48.670
We were classmates in school.

01:48.670 --> 01:51.080
Joined the Magic Bureau at the same time.

01:51.080 --> 01:54.130
The guy had even better grades than I did.

01:54.130 --> 01:56.630
Just kept on climbin' that
corporate ladder, y'know?

01:57.250 --> 02:00.250
Then one day, I found him out.

02:00.250 --> 02:02.460
He'd been committing fraud.

02:03.000 --> 02:06.290
I exposed his wrongdoings to the world.

02:06.580 --> 02:10.420
Of course, he lost everything.
And in his despair, he...

02:13.630 --> 02:18.920
And that's when you took your friend's place
on the fast track to success. Is that right?

02:18.920 --> 02:23.330
Oooh, bonus points for the sarcasm, Freddie!

02:24.080 --> 02:25.420
Well...

02:25.420 --> 02:27.460
now that I'm what the kids would call "old,"

02:27.460 --> 02:30.380
I'd probably choose to settle things
in private instead.

02:31.330 --> 02:36.000
Nevertheless, I don't think my younger self
made the wrong decision.

02:36.750 --> 02:39.290
He was headed down the wrong path...

02:39.290 --> 02:41.330
and I corrected him.

02:42.040 --> 02:43.670
It was painful for me...

02:43.670 --> 02:46.210
I still dream about him sometimes.

02:47.580 --> 02:49.210
Give me a break...

02:49.750 --> 02:55.080
You think I'd hesitate to wipe the floor
with that vile terrorist if given the chance?

02:55.420 --> 02:57.540
No. Not even for a second.

02:57.540 --> 02:59.710
I'll go. By myself.

02:59.710 --> 03:02.580
And your gentle persuasion isn't necessary.

03:06.380 --> 03:07.710
Thanks.

03:08.290 --> 03:10.710
Just make sure you come back alive.

03:16.920 --> 03:18.500
Good boy...

03:19.040 --> 03:23.460
You truly are my kind of man... Freddie.

04:54.420 --> 04:57.000
<b>Land for Sale</b>

04:54.420 --> 04:57.000
<b>#9 A Hero Conflicted</b>

04:57.000 --> 05:00.420
<b>#9 A Hero Conflicted</b>

04:59.420 --> 05:00.420
Your Grace...

05:00.960 --> 05:05.080
About my analysis of the substance,
I may end up needing a little more time.

05:05.080 --> 05:07.670
Hm... Well, I suppose that's alright.

05:07.670 --> 05:09.580
It is what it is.

05:10.210 --> 05:11.880
Hiya, Max.

05:11.880 --> 05:13.960
Yesterday sure was rough, huh?

05:13.960 --> 05:16.290
Is your stomach feeling better now?

05:21.920 --> 05:23.080
Oh Max...

05:23.080 --> 05:26.250
You're really broken up about it, aren't you?

05:26.250 --> 05:28.420
I've never seen you cry like that before...

05:37.670 --> 05:38.500
Huh?

05:38.500 --> 05:41.580
HEY! What the hell is THIS?!

05:41.580 --> 05:45.380
Have you been moping around
because you lost a stupid bet?!

05:41.580 --> 05:44.210
<b>Boat Racing KYOTEI</b>

05:44.210 --> 05:48.250
<b>[Straight Bet]</b>

05:44.210 --> 05:48.250
<b>1. Tanaka</b>

05:44.210 --> 05:48.250
<b>¥89,000</b>

05:45.380 --> 05:46.670
What's the matter with you?!

05:46.670 --> 05:49.250
And why are you gambling in the first place?!

05:48.250 --> 05:50.250
<b>Sorry! Better luck next time.</b>

05:48.250 --> 05:50.250
<b>All bets are final.</b>

05:49.250 --> 05:50.250
Are you insane?!

05:50.540 --> 05:54.080
You can't go blowing 90,000 yen on a boat
when you don't even have a job!

05:54.080 --> 05:57.710
Yeah, but... if I won,
the payout woulda been 40-to-1...

05:57.710 --> 05:59.460
That's a load of bull!

05:59.460 --> 06:01.210
Okay, okay...

06:01.210 --> 06:03.540
I'll be sure to make a safer bet next time.

06:03.880 --> 06:05.500
Money, pwease!

06:05.880 --> 06:08.750
Fine, but I'm only giving you 50,000.

06:08.750 --> 06:10.710
DON'T ENABLE HIM!

06:12.630 --> 06:15.210
This isn't the time to be focused on
gambling of all things...

06:15.210 --> 06:20.880
<b>Beskar Kingdom Ministry Emergency Press Conference</b>

06:15.880 --> 06:17.250
Take a look at the TV.

06:17.250 --> 06:20.880
The Kingdom will NOT give in to
the demands of terrorists!

06:21.210 --> 06:23.580
It is with a heavy heart that we, the Kingdom,

06:23.580 --> 06:27.380
must launch our operation to destroy
the Gamma Republic.

06:27.580 --> 06:29.830
Quite the nuisance, isn't it?

06:29.830 --> 06:35.000
<b>What's your opinion on</b>

06:29.830 --> 06:35.000
<b>the Ministry's response?</b>

06:29.830 --> 06:35.000
<b>Woman, 20</b>

06:30.080 --> 06:32.330
Plus, the whole thing's kinda scary.

06:32.330 --> 06:35.000
I just hope they get it over with quickly, y'know?

06:35.170 --> 06:38.000
And it's like... where's the Hero?

06:38.000 --> 06:40.920
Wasn't his friend the one who
caused all this crap?

06:40.920 --> 06:44.080
<b>What's your opinion on</b>

06:40.920 --> 06:44.080
<b>the Ministry's response?</b>

06:40.920 --> 06:44.080
<b>Woman, 40</b>

06:41.170 --> 06:44.080
They have the power to stop this,
so why haven't they?

06:44.380 --> 06:47.130
He needs to step up and
take responsibility, don't you think?

06:47.130 --> 06:50.960
Gimme a break!
What am I, their mother?

06:52.250 --> 06:53.960
These people, I swear...

06:53.960 --> 06:55.830
Max? Where are you going?

06:55.830 --> 06:57.080
For a walk.

06:57.080 --> 06:58.420
I'll come, too!

07:01.080 --> 07:05.210
If I leave him to his own devices,
he might blow 100,000 on a horse this time.

07:06.710 --> 07:08.330
See you later!

07:21.830 --> 07:23.580
I know you said a walk, but...

07:23.580 --> 07:25.920
is there anywhere you wanna go?

07:25.920 --> 07:28.580
If I was ALONE, there would be...

07:28.580 --> 07:31.960
Oh! Then we oughtta go together!

07:31.960 --> 07:34.170
No need to hold back on my account!

07:34.170 --> 07:35.250
Nope!

07:35.250 --> 07:37.130
What's THAT supposed to mean?!

07:35.250 --> 07:45.290
<b>One Room Video</b>

07:37.130 --> 07:39.630
Why do you hate hanging out with me?!

07:39.630 --> 07:40.710
Just tell me!

07:40.710 --> 07:42.580
Give it a rest, wouldja?

07:42.580 --> 07:45.290
It's not the kind of place ya go
with another person.

07:45.670 --> 07:48.830
Good thing I'm not a person.
I'm the Demon Lord!

07:48.830 --> 07:50.380
Quit arguing semantics!

07:50.630 --> 07:53.380
Human or demon, it ain't gonna happen-!

07:53.960 --> 07:55.710
Not JUST a demon.

07:55.710 --> 07:57.670
Demon LORD, thanks very much!

07:57.670 --> 07:58.750
Whatever.

07:58.750 --> 08:01.790
Hey, it's you. Is she your girlfriend?

08:03.290 --> 08:05.290
Don't I know you from somewhere...?

08:06.000 --> 08:07.580
Oh, I remember!

08:07.580 --> 08:10.000
You were playing soccer with Max the other day.

08:10.290 --> 08:13.500
I appreciate you always looking out
for my associate here.

08:13.500 --> 08:14.380
Thot.

08:14.380 --> 08:16.170
E-excuse me?!

08:16.460 --> 08:18.710
What did you just say, you urchin?!

08:18.710 --> 08:21.710
Where did you even learn
language like that?!

08:21.710 --> 08:23.710
You talk funny.

08:25.290 --> 08:27.170
Whatcha got there, kiddo?

08:27.170 --> 08:28.630
Badminton racquet.

08:28.630 --> 08:30.500
But yer all by yerself.

08:30.500 --> 08:31.580
Yup.

08:31.580 --> 08:33.830
I wanted someone to play with.

08:33.830 --> 08:35.080
Play with me.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.670
Aw, jeez...

08:36.670 --> 08:39.000
What a pain in the ass.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.460
Go play with yer friends.

08:40.460 --> 08:42.670
Where's the harm, Max?

08:42.670 --> 08:45.670
At least it's better for your health
than gambling.

08:45.830 --> 08:48.750
<b>Sergendine 2nd District Park</b>

08:48.920 --> 08:51.920
The old man loses another round!

08:52.250 --> 08:55.210
Yer pretty good at this, ain'tcha, missy?

08:55.210 --> 08:57.000
You're a sucky partner.

08:57.000 --> 08:59.500
Is this why you didn't amount to anything?

08:59.500 --> 09:00.920
Oof, harsh...

09:03.880 --> 09:06.250
Yer mom doin' okay?

09:06.460 --> 09:09.540
Yeah. Her belly's huge though.

09:09.960 --> 09:11.960
She's having my little brother soon.

09:11.960 --> 09:14.830
Oh, you must be excited!

09:14.830 --> 09:15.790
Here.

09:16.750 --> 09:18.710
It's your turn, Big Sis.

09:19.500 --> 09:21.290
You're challenging ME?

09:21.290 --> 09:23.750
Alright then! I won't go easy on you!

09:23.750 --> 09:25.460
That's not what I meant.

09:25.460 --> 09:27.920
You and Max should play.

09:27.920 --> 09:29.710
I'm going to watch.

09:29.710 --> 09:32.210
Huh? Uh, I guess that's fine...

09:32.540 --> 09:35.750
If she catches wind of your powers,
we're in trouble.

09:35.750 --> 09:37.460
Just act natural.

09:37.460 --> 09:39.290
I gotcha.

09:39.540 --> 09:41.000
Here it comes!

09:41.000 --> 09:43.000
Take this!

09:50.710 --> 09:52.540
Are you sure it's a good idea
to just leave things be...?

09:52.540 --> 09:57.080
Your former companions are about to
go to war with each other.

09:57.540 --> 09:59.790
Goddammit, not you too...

10:00.500 --> 10:03.830
They were my friends ten years ago.

10:03.830 --> 10:05.880
Not my circus...

10:06.920 --> 10:09.880
not my monkeys! Right?!

10:10.710 --> 10:13.170
Leo and Fred could die...

10:13.170 --> 10:16.960
You're just going to sit back
and let that happen?!

10:17.250 --> 10:19.670
Why should I care?!

10:20.750 --> 10:23.380
It's THEIR decision to make.

10:23.380 --> 10:24.960
Far as I'm concerned...

10:24.960 --> 10:28.250
strikin' it rich with the boat races
is more important than THAT bullshit!

10:34.130 --> 10:36.500
The Max I knew ten years ago...

10:36.920 --> 10:39.960
NEVER would have said something like that!

10:39.960 --> 10:42.580
NEVER! NEVER! NEVER!

10:46.080 --> 10:48.290
That's the thing about humans...

10:51.750 --> 10:55.130
We're completely different people
after ten years!

10:55.130 --> 10:57.710
Ain't got the luxury of bein' young forever!

10:57.880 --> 11:03.080
It's somethin' YOU freaks of nature
could never understand!

11:09.080 --> 11:11.040
HYAAAAA!

11:11.040 --> 11:13.290
DIEEEEE!

11:21.830 --> 11:23.500
That was awesome.

11:23.500 --> 11:26.670
Good job, Mr. Hero.
I've gained some respect for you.

11:26.670 --> 11:28.250
'Preciate it, kiddo...

11:28.540 --> 11:30.960
So much for "acting natural"!

11:30.960 --> 11:32.710
You went and made it personal!

11:32.710 --> 11:35.670
ME?! Yer the one who went full tilt!

11:35.670 --> 11:39.000
Ha! You thought THAT was my real power?

11:39.000 --> 11:41.130
It seems the Hero's lost his edge!

11:41.130 --> 11:43.130
Shut yer stupid trap!

11:43.130 --> 11:46.130
And get the hell outta my mind, ya bastard!

11:46.130 --> 11:48.460
Excuse me?!

11:51.460 --> 11:53.330
Oh, I almost forgot.

11:53.330 --> 11:55.670
I brought a souvenir for you, Max.

11:55.670 --> 11:56.790
Here.

11:58.630 --> 11:59.960
A piece of candy?

11:59.960 --> 12:02.420
Yup. I was told to give it to you.

12:03.080 --> 12:06.500
Hey, Big Sis.
Teach me your badminton technique.

12:06.500 --> 12:10.750
Huh? Oh, that was just a fluke.

12:12.380 --> 12:14.670
WAH-HAAAAAH!

12:16.000 --> 12:17.790
This chick...

12:17.790 --> 12:21.250
The hell does she want me to do...?

12:23.580 --> 12:25.210
Max, watch out.

12:28.630 --> 12:32.130
Captain Galmoff!
Preparations for the attack are complete!

12:32.130 --> 12:33.630
Listen up, Fred!

12:33.630 --> 12:37.880
You'd better not step out of line!
My troops will move in first, and then-

12:37.880 --> 12:39.080
No need, Captain.

12:39.080 --> 12:39.920
What?

12:39.920 --> 12:41.630
I'd like the Royal Army to stay here

12:41.630 --> 12:46.000
and ensure that the media and all other
civilians refrain from entering the area.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.790
D-don't be absurd!

12:47.790 --> 12:50.880
You intend to turn us into a bunch
of slack-jawed spectators?!

12:50.880 --> 12:54.170
We can avoid any unnecessary
bloodshed that way.

12:54.170 --> 12:55.830
Don't insult me!

12:55.830 --> 12:57.750
You're just as bad as Leo!

12:57.750 --> 13:00.540
Whose fault do you think this war is, anyway?!

13:00.790 --> 13:03.960
Listen to me: I am the commanding
officer for this operation!

13:03.960 --> 13:06.330
So just shut your mouth and follow my orders!

13:06.330 --> 13:08.210
You freakish misfits are-

13:10.790 --> 13:11.790
Huh?

13:13.250 --> 13:15.420
Shut up...

13:15.420 --> 13:16.830
I don't care!

13:17.670 --> 13:20.500
Wh-what are you doing, Chief Secretary?!

13:20.500 --> 13:22.500
If the Ministry hears about this, you'll be-

13:22.500 --> 13:25.500
They'll strip me of my position
as chief secretary.

13:26.630 --> 13:29.790
But none of that matters to me anymore.

13:29.790 --> 13:32.630
Let's end this once and for all... Leo.

13:35.420 --> 13:36.710
Former Chief Secretary.

13:36.710 --> 13:38.170
What is it, my former subordinate?

13:38.170 --> 13:40.380
Wow, you got over that fast...

13:40.670 --> 13:44.540
They're using a powerful barrier spell
to protect that wall.

13:44.830 --> 13:49.080
The Kingdom's magical weapons
weren't even able to put a dent in it.

13:49.710 --> 13:53.630
And despite the situation, we haven't
heard a peep out of anyone inside.

13:53.630 --> 13:56.380
Makes me wonder
what the Republic's up to...

13:56.380 --> 13:57.750
Their stronghold is empty.

13:57.750 --> 13:59.420
What? Seriously?

13:59.420 --> 14:01.630
They've probably already realized...

14:01.630 --> 14:05.130
that there's no point in
defending this place anymore.

14:05.830 --> 14:07.710
A very wise decision.

14:28.040 --> 14:31.380
Now then... I've got one last order:

14:31.710 --> 14:34.000
Don't let ANYONE cross this moat.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.330
I..I'll come-

14:35.330 --> 14:36.630
Understood.

14:37.170 --> 14:38.880
Thanks for everything.

14:43.830 --> 14:45.170
Chief Secretary...

14:45.580 --> 14:49.290
If he was going to fly,
did he really have to destroy the wall...?

14:50.960 --> 14:53.460
Following a large blast mere moments ago,

14:53.460 --> 14:56.750
the border wall separating the Kingdom
and the Republic has been demolished!

14:56.750 --> 14:59.830
It would appear that a
full-fledged battle has begun,

14:59.830 --> 15:03.790
but rigid travel restrictions remain in place
as the situation continues to-

15:04.710 --> 15:10.630
<b>LIVE* Beskar Kingdom Border</b>

15:04.710 --> 15:10.630
<b>Breaking News: Hostilities and</b>

15:04.710 --> 15:10.630
<b>Explosions Near the Border</b>

15:04.920 --> 15:08.000
I-it seems there's been another explosion of light!

15:08.000 --> 15:10.630
Was it another one of
Chief Secretary Fred's magic spells?!

15:10.630 --> 15:14.170
Oh-ho, look at our boy go!

15:14.170 --> 15:16.210
Leave it to the Hero's pals.

15:16.210 --> 15:18.880
Love it when they put on a show!

15:18.880 --> 15:22.460
Give 'em hell, Freddie!

15:22.460 --> 15:26.290
It'd be fantastic if you could win
and lay this whole fiasco to rest...

15:26.750 --> 15:29.960
If Leo goes down,
the Republic will collapse.

15:29.960 --> 15:33.540
But even if Fred were to lose...
it's a done deal.

15:33.540 --> 15:37.250
"The Republic's" terrorist attacks
won't stop any time soon.

15:37.250 --> 15:41.080
Trachigo allied with the Republic
for access to resources,

15:41.080 --> 15:44.290
but they'll be forced to plead ignorance
and rescind support.

15:44.630 --> 15:49.000
And without Trachigo backing them,
the Republic stands alone.

15:49.460 --> 15:52.830
After that, we simply wait until
they starve to death.

15:53.290 --> 15:54.670
That being said,

15:54.670 --> 15:58.920
the idea of losing my darling Fred
sure does make this old man sad...

15:59.210 --> 16:00.960
Well, if push comes to shove,

16:00.960 --> 16:04.830
I'll pick someone more open-minded
to be the next chief secretary...

16:05.790 --> 16:07.420
Your Excellency!

16:07.420 --> 16:08.920
I've got terrible news!

16:08.920 --> 16:10.460
What? What's the matter?

16:10.460 --> 16:13.830
Wait a minute...
Isn't today my day off?

16:13.830 --> 16:16.130
There's no time for relaxing, sir!

16:16.130 --> 16:18.000
It's being broadcast live!

16:18.000 --> 16:19.250
Huh...?

16:18.750 --> 16:21.960
<b>LIVE* Beskar Kingdom Border</b>

16:18.750 --> 16:21.960
<b>Breaking News: Hostilities and</b>

16:18.750 --> 16:21.960
<b>Explosions Near the Border</b>

16:19.250 --> 16:21.960
Well, yeah. I can see it
on the television right there...

16:22.250 --> 16:24.460
That's not what I meant! Here, look!

16:24.460 --> 16:26.540
Hm? What am I looking at?

16:26.540 --> 16:28.830
A PooCube livestream...?

16:28.830 --> 16:32.880
"The Kingdom Invades the Gamma Republic!
Happening Live!"

16:32.880 --> 16:36.000
What the hell?!
How are they getting this footage?!

16:36.000 --> 16:38.960
I thought the media wasn't allowed
past the border wall!

16:42.330 --> 16:43.750
HEY!

16:43.920 --> 16:46.830
Don't turn your back on me, Fred!

16:46.830 --> 16:48.710
What kind of idiot do you think I-?!

16:51.710 --> 16:53.420
Yikes...

16:53.420 --> 16:55.380
Yo, Fred's a beast...

16:55.380 --> 16:58.750
Who in the hell...?!
Which TV station is filming this?!

16:58.750 --> 17:01.380
How should I know?!
I thought it was you guys!

17:01.380 --> 17:03.040
So how do I watch it...?

17:03.040 --> 17:06.210
Are you seriously not on any social media...?

17:06.420 --> 17:08.040
You've gotta be kidding me!

17:08.040 --> 17:11.290
If they stream it live and shit hits the fan,
we can't make any excuses!

17:11.290 --> 17:12.580
Ban the account! Ban it!

17:12.580 --> 17:15.250
Each time we remove the video,
it gets re-uploaded!

17:15.250 --> 17:17.170
<b>Reinhardt</b>

17:15.250 --> 17:17.170
<b>Mobile</b>

17:18.630 --> 17:20.170
Where's Grimms?!

17:20.170 --> 17:23.540
He must be the one who put Fred up to this!

17:23.540 --> 17:26.630
What are we supposed to do
if he spills state secrets?!

17:26.630 --> 17:29.210
C'mon, Grimms! Where ARE you?!

17:29.210 --> 17:31.750
Grimms, is this your handiwork?

17:31.750 --> 17:33.500
No, no! Of course not!

17:33.500 --> 17:36.960
All I did was convince Fred to fight
on behalf of the Kingdom!

17:37.290 --> 17:40.210
I never meant for it to be
broadcast to the entire world!

17:40.210 --> 17:41.540
Are you sure...?

17:42.540 --> 17:44.540
There are times when I don't know

17:44.540 --> 17:47.290
what's going on in that
head of yours, Grimms...

17:49.210 --> 17:52.420
No matter how this plays out,
it HAS to end here...

17:52.830 --> 17:54.750
Is the drone rolling right now?

17:54.750 --> 17:57.750
Yup, no problems on my end.
What about you?

17:59.630 --> 18:01.880
<b>The Kingdom Invades the Gamma Republic!</b>

17:59.630 --> 18:01.880
<b>Happening LIVE!!</b>

18:00.040 --> 18:03.040
I set up 7,700 throwaway accounts just for this!

18:03.040 --> 18:05.330
They can't possibly take them all down!

18:05.330 --> 18:07.210
Hopping the moat,
climbing the wall, sneaking in,

18:07.210 --> 18:09.540
and camping out in the woods paid off!

18:09.540 --> 18:12.880
Kinda wish you'd take
MY feelings into consideration...

18:13.540 --> 18:17.130
Chief Secretary Fred
clearly knows he's on camera.

18:17.130 --> 18:21.380
Honestly, I expected him to smash it
with his magic as soon as he noticed.

18:21.380 --> 18:23.830
If he lets us film him,
I certainly won't complain!

18:23.830 --> 18:25.670
Just seems weird, is all.

18:25.670 --> 18:29.830
I'd think the Kingdom would scramble
to stop this footage from leaking.

18:29.830 --> 18:32.920
He probably doesn't care about
any of that anymore.

18:32.920 --> 18:37.000
The Hero and his companions
fought to protect the Kingdom.

18:37.000 --> 18:41.170
And now the Kingdom's got them
at each others' throats...

18:41.500 --> 18:44.460
Fred's a patient man,
but even HE has his limits.

18:44.460 --> 18:45.960
His position, his reputation...

18:45.960 --> 18:48.250
He's throwing it ALL out the window
for this fight.

18:48.250 --> 18:51.250
Challenging Leo, his brother-in-arms...

18:51.250 --> 18:53.790
Something like that, it's...

18:55.790 --> 18:59.040
...ABSOLUTELY the type of entertainment
people want to see!

18:59.040 --> 19:00.670
Agreed.

19:00.670 --> 19:02.710
Now, keep the camera rolling!

19:02.710 --> 19:05.500
We have to expose the TRUTH!

19:05.500 --> 19:06.790
Gotcha.

19:20.130 --> 19:21.250
Ouch.

19:22.460 --> 19:23.790
You came, eh?

19:23.790 --> 19:26.750
What's with the atrocious hairstyle?

19:26.750 --> 19:28.500
Trying to attract a woman?

19:28.500 --> 19:30.880
You're too old for that.

19:30.880 --> 19:33.710
Sounded like my men
tried to stand in your way.

19:33.710 --> 19:36.460
THAT'S your reaction to me
knocking them unconscious?

19:36.830 --> 19:39.330
Aren't you worried about their injuries?

19:40.580 --> 19:44.580
I'm more worried they might get bitten by bugs
while they're laid out on the ground.

19:44.580 --> 19:47.460
I told 'em not to interfere, but...

19:47.460 --> 19:48.630
Sorry, Fred.

19:48.630 --> 19:51.290
Then you should've waited
closer to the wall...

19:51.630 --> 19:54.750
I almost forgot.
Have you met up with Max lately?

19:54.750 --> 19:56.500
Wait, did YOU see him?

19:56.500 --> 19:59.290
Yeah, he surprised the shit outta me.

19:59.290 --> 20:02.380
That bastard... He was telling the truth...

20:02.380 --> 20:03.540
I'll kill him!

20:03.540 --> 20:05.790
Man, I didn't even recognize him at first!

20:05.790 --> 20:07.630
He was wearing glasses and everything!

20:07.630 --> 20:10.330
But he hasn't lost his touch.

20:10.330 --> 20:11.880
He's still strong as hell.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.750
We leavin' that contraption alone?

20:17.130 --> 20:20.830
If you'd prefer not to be on camera,
feel free to smash it.

20:22.170 --> 20:25.420
In that case, why don't we
make it easier for 'em?

20:30.630 --> 20:31.920
No way!

20:34.250 --> 20:35.710
Good enough?

20:35.710 --> 20:37.540
Nah, it's a special occasion.

20:37.540 --> 20:39.580
How about we do them one better?

20:43.420 --> 20:45.500
Ugh, that's a lotta dust!

20:45.500 --> 20:46.920
Did the drone make it?

20:46.920 --> 20:48.670
Somehow, yeah...

20:50.630 --> 20:52.460
Whoa...

21:10.080 --> 21:11.670
Not bad, right?

21:12.290 --> 21:14.920
Yeah. It's got a great view.

21:22.380 --> 21:24.420
Nice knowin' ya, Fred.

21:25.290 --> 21:29.130
I'm going to turn this into your grave, Leo.

21:32.580 --> 21:34.500
Leo, Fred...

21:34.500 --> 21:36.830
How did it come to this...?
